Brand typography choices
title end

paragraph start
Choose at most two typefaces, one for display and one for reading, each with a fallback. Both must stay legible at phone size and carry a licence that covers commercial use in video and products.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Read the licence text on the source page of every font before use and store a licence note beside the font file. Never assume a free font is free for commercial use.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
role, typeface, weight, licence note, source page, date checked
code end

